# Core Purity

- Do not reference `Microsoft.Maui.*`, app UI projects, platform folders, file pickers, camera APIs, Shell navigation, or UI controls.
- Core owns deterministic image preprocessing, tensor creation, ONNX output parsing, thresholding, and overlay geometry.
- Use abstractions for model execution and file access when tests need seams; keep platform-specific behavior outside Core.
- Public Core behavior must be covered by xUnit tests and traceable to `FR-*` IDs.
- Keep image math deterministic and allocation-conscious; prefer explicit dimensions and channel ordering over inferred conventions.
